<h1>Prompt Like a Developer</h1>

You already know a strong prompt needs a Task, Context, Tone/Format, and Details. 

Professional developers add three more habits on top of that. They: 
- state their goals clearly
- define the constraints up front
- think through edge cases

Below is one real prompt built from all three habits. Click each highlighted part to see the job it's doing.

